## Production checklist

- [ ] Change Grafana credentials (`GF_SECURITY_ADMIN_PASSWORD`)
- [ ] Set `OTEL_SAMPLING_PROBABILITY=0.1` (staging) or `0.05` (prod) per service
- [ ] Replace in-memory H2 databases with persistent ones if applicable
- [ ] Configure resource limits on all Docker containers
- [ ] Set up external volumes for Grafana, Prometheus/Mimir, and Loki data
